{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-03b0449cee0d", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:29:54.264Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:30:01.890Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 15533, "tokens_out": 264, "latency": 0.2644, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0088 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:70c76050ccf0db1ef2e489f5feb32d1b36ca5bf2e4f814df69c1f155d8ca702d", "response_text": "## Status Summary: TM-2026-0088\n\n**Claim Details**\n- **Policyholder:** N. Baptiste\n- **Policy:** TM-MOT-771205 (Motor, theft)\n- **Incident Date:** 30 June 2026\n- **Notified:** 1 July 2026\n- **Handler:** D. Ferreira\n\n**Current Status:** Open\n- Reserve: £16,400\n- Paid to date: £0\n\n**Position**\nA vehicle was stolen from a driveway overnight with keys left in the house. Crime reference obtained. Two fraud indicators have been identified:\n1. Policy incepted only 19 days before the incident\n2. No independent witness to the theft\n\nA counter-fraud referral was raised on 2 July 2026. **No payment is being made pending the outcome of the fraud investigation.**\n\n**Next Steps**\n1. Await the counter-fraud investigation outcome\n2. Once fraud assessment is concluded, determine whether to settle, decline or seek further information\n3. If fraud is cleared, process settlement in line with policy terms\n\nIs there anything specific about this claim you need to action?", "response_hash": "sha256:22d23d537876cbc266b01262ef0078a924889dfb623a29e6f37c64f9c5f83c6c", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
